            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f2" n="2" xml:id="d137-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Rogers informed the President of details
                    of the first Swiss-Cuban meeting on the proposed Cuban Hijacking Agreement.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
